ا حارس أمن، يتفاجأ فريق يعمل في نقل الأموال بمهاراته العالية عندما يتعرضون لعملية سطو مسلح، ويبدأون بالتساؤل حول من يكون فعلا هذا الرجل الغامض...","description_en":"A cold and mysterious new security guard for a Los Angeles cash truck company surprises his co-workers when he unleashes precision skills during a heist. The crew is left wondering who he is and where he came from. Soon, the marksman's ultimate motive becomes clear as he takes dramatic and irrevocable steps to settle a score.","description_fr":"Un convoyeur de fond, fraîchement engagé, surprend ses collègues par l’incroyable précision de ses tirs de riposte, alors qu’ils subissent les assauts de braqueurs expérimentés. Tous se demandent désormais qui il est, d’où il vient et pourquoi il est là.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8XzwPD0QCH5J8TGReIxZpL4ZZa.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/70AV2Xx5FQYj20labp0EGdbjI6E.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":7.6,"vote_count":6427,"age_rating":"R","year":"2021","release_date":"2021-04-22","runtime_minutes":119,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["إثارة","جريمة","دراما","أكشن"],"genre_keys":["thriller","crime","drama","action"],"similar":["mv449443","mv536437","mv71305","mv30497","mv130150","mv83542","mv291805","mv83686"],"director":"غاي ريتشي","cast":[{"name":"جيسون ستاثام","character":"H","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8l6lmrmKFDvhDjMJPj6tBpJdhaA.jpg"},{"name":"هولت مكالاني","character":"Bullet","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/b1FEXFQ8ZnvXhVrMqCv5mTJ8aW3.jpg"},{"name":"Rocci Williams","character":"Hollow Bob","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/e5GWh54fUmbupb5DKsSNU5axEx2.jpg"},{"name":"جوش هارتنت","character":"Boy Sweat Dave","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5eMo8D7h1XrSu6ZN4UXhPcS6YNG.jpg"},{"name":"Jeffrey Donovan","character":"Jackson","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wlDXfXpu6Uz32LUmbFzU8QPDoQH.jpg"},{"name":"Sc